WEBVTT


00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:07.940
Mudlarking is kind of searching and collecting of items

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:11.000
that you find down on the river bank

00:00:12.140 --> 00:00:13.060
The more you do it,

00:00:13.061 --> 00:00:16.340
the more your eye kind of trains to the shapes you're looking for

00:00:16.341 --> 00:00:18.600
and what things are made of

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:22.560
Being in a city and being able to find an escape

00:00:22.561 --> 00:00:24.740
from the hustle and bustle,

00:00:24.741 --> 00:00:26.960
it's really nice to kind of slow down and

00:00:26.961 --> 00:00:28.839
just look at things for a while
